# URLs to ignore during link checking (one regex per line).
# These sites use Cloudflare bot protection (JS challenge), block bots,
# or rate-limit automated requests that no HTTP-based link checker can bypass.

# Cloudflare bot protection (403 with JS challenge)
^https://www\.researchgate\.net(/.*)?$
^https://www\.hindawi\.com(/.*)?$
^https://electronics\.stackexchange\.com(/.*)?$
^https://www\.everythingrf\.com(/.*)?$
^https://www\.linkedin\.com(/.*)?$
^https://upload\.wikimedia\.org(/.*)?$
^https://web\.archive\.org(/.*)?$

